// PNG binary - Hello World! :: RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   colour     : not assigned by Linguist
//   layer      : full (byte-balanced rainbow bar)
//   upstream   : https://github.com/quxianp/RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   reference  : see https://esolangs.org/ and https://rosettacode.org/

# A real 1x1 PNG whose tEXt chunk carries "Hello World!", written
# with zlib for the IDAT. Every chunk is length, tag, data, CRC32.
0000  89 50 4E 47 0D 0A 1A 0A 00 00 00 0D 49 48 44 52 |.PNG........IHDR|
0010  00 00 00 01 00 00 00 01 08 00 00 00 00 3A 7E 9B |.............:~.|
0020  55 00 00 00 14 74 45 58 74 43 6F 6D 6D 65 6E 74 |U....tEXtComment|
0030  00 48 65 6C 6C 6F 20 57 6F 72 6C 64 21 AC 9E B5 |.Hello World!...|
0040  1E 00 00 00 0A 49 44 41 54 78 9C 63 60 00 00 00 |.....IDATx.c`...|
0050  02 00 01 48 AF A4 71 00 00 00 00 49 45 4E 44 AE |...H..q....IEND.|
0060  42 60 82                                        |B`.|
